cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Deepfake Detektor: a self-hosted web system that checks video, images and audio for manipulation"
abstract: >-
  A web application that analyses video, image and audio files for face swaps and synthetic
  speech. It reports a fake probability with a three-way verdict (real, suspicious, fake),
  highlights the regions that influenced the model with Grad-CAM, and produces PDF reports in
  Turkmen, Russian and English.
authors:
